# COMPONENT

## OperationEntitySample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.operationentity

### DESCRIPTION

Operation and entity integration sample.

# ENTITY

## Person

### SUMMARY

Person entity.

### DESCRIPTION

Minimal entity used by an operation-oriented service.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type     | multiplicity |
|------+----------+--------------|
| id   | entityid | 1            |
| name | name     | 1            |

# SERVICE

## PersonApp

### DESCRIPTION

User-facing operation layer that sits beside the entity service.

### OPERATION

#### getPersonCard

Returns a typed person card contract for a person id.

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### SUMMARY

Return a person card.

##### DESCRIPTION

Shows a query-oriented operation contract in a component that also owns an entity.

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
PersonLookup

###### SUMMARY

Person lookup payload.

###### DESCRIPTION

Structured query input accepted by getPersonCard.

###### VALUE

####### PersonLookup

######## EXTENDS

QueryAction

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name     | type     | multiplicity |
|----------+----------+--------------|
| personId | entityid | 1            |

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
PersonCard

###### SUMMARY

Person card payload.

###### DESCRIPTION

Structured result returned by getPersonCard.

###### VALUE

####### PersonCard

######## EXTENDS

OperationResult

######## ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------+------|--------------|
| name | name | 1            |
